{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to carefully parse this complex question. Let me break it down:\n\n1. There's an award created in the 2000s.\n2. A book was a contender for this award.\n3. This book was translated into over 25 languages.\n4. In the 2010s, the year this book was published, another book (released the preceding year) won the award.\n5. The author of the prize-winning book was born in the same city where the author of the first book grew up.\n6. Question: In what city was the author of the first book born?\n\nLet me start searching for awards created in the 2000s.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created founded 2000s\", \"international book prize established 2000s translated twenty languages\", \"novel translated over 25 languages award contender\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_c65187f246074e1bbbd2bd95","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789481813,"id":"chatcmpl-f33661f3-76df-9cb2-8e61-4d98030e2552","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":185,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4055,"cached_tokens":3200,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3200},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}